process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary evo_auth ⟦
        rule evolution_safety ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧
    reasoning_chain evo_log with evo_auth ⟦ capacity ↦ 30 · ⟧

    text s1 ↦ "state_a" ·
    text s2 ↦ "state_b" ·
    text r ↦ "reason_x" ·

    evolve from s1 to s2 with reason r into p ·
    corrupt_evolve p at ↦ 16 ·
    evolve_history to evo_log ·
    emit "Unreachable" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧

